<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">Emerging growth company <span id="xdx_901_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20230526__20230526_z5rqOQaNzls4"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-05-26to2023-05-26" format="ixt:booleantrue" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

